# The team works on Windows, macOS and Linux. Normalize line endings in the repo
# so a Windows checkout cannot turn every file into a whole-file diff, and so the
# claim proofs and shell scripts keep LF endings - bash reads a CRLF script as
# commands ending in a stray carriage return and fails with confusing errors.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
